; Concrete Kummer unit lemma from Cyclotomic/Three.lean:97-128.
; A square-lambda divisor gives an actual factor of 3 in the omega
; coordinate. The four nonreal standard units have coordinate 1 or -1,
; contradicting 3 not dividing 1. Thus the unit is 1 or -1.
